      "side": 1,
      "message": "Turns out there are very few instances of sizeof(T) \u003d\u003d 2 or 4. sizeof(T) \u003d\u003d 1 is used frequently for verbs in paths, and AA information for clipping. Adding the branches for 2, and 4 slowed down execution compared to only handling sizeof(T) \u003d\u003d 1.\n\nI measured the handling 1, 2 and 4 compared to only handling 1.",
      "parentUuid": "205db8ec_95c3828e",
      "revId": "a1138aad2b810c459f31f83ce27fe35bd1f17d4e",
